    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trying to escape from the Magic Academy, but a powerful spell prevents you from exiting the final corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's possible to break the spell if you pass the final corridor an eighth time without fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Rules</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corridor 0 is always correct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you see a difference in another corridor, turn around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything is normal, continue straight ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There must be no difference in corridor 8 to exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The Game</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Octorridor is a small observation duty game that immerses you in a magical, colorful universe, in a liminal space where your goal will be to escape from this labyrinthine corridor by dodging the wrong paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Playing time</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 - 60 min</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The number of differences</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 40+ differences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enough to vary your searches in the corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Difficulty</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to pay attention to every detail of the corridor to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty should be accessible to everyone with a good sense of observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Controls</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Pc version</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>W, A, S, D (or Z, Q, S, D)</i> : Move your caracter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mouse</i> : Look arround</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Left Click</i> : Interact (use to open doors)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shift (hold)</i> : You can sprint !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Esc</i> : Open setting menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Setting</i> : Sensitivity, Volume</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sensitivity</i> : You can increase or decrease your mouse sensitivity. Default setting is 0,5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Volume</i> : You can increase or decrease your volume (no anomaly uses sound). Default setting is 50.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trying to escape from the Magic Academy, but a powerful spell prevents you from exiting the final corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's possible to break the spell if you pass the final corridor an eighth time without fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Rules</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corridor 0 is always correct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you see a difference in another corridor, turn around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything is normal, continue straight ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There must be no difference in corridor 8 to exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The Game</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Octorridor is a small observation duty game that immerses you in a magical, colorful universe, in a liminal space where your goal will be to escape from this labyrinthine corridor by dodging the wrong paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Playing time</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 - 60 min</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The number of differences</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 40+ differences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enough to vary your searches in the corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Difficulty</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to pay attention to every detail of the corridor to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty should be accessible to everyone with a good sense of observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Controls</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Pc version</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>W, A, S, D (or Z, Q, S, D)</i> : Move your caracter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mouse</i> : Look arround</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Left Click</i> : Interact (use to open doors)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shift (hold)</i> : You can sprint !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Esc</i> : Open setting menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Setting</i> : Sensitivity, Volume</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sensitivity</i> : You can increase or decrease your mouse sensitivity. Default setting is 0,5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Volume</i> : You can increase or decrease your volume (no anomaly uses sound). Default setting is 50.</p>",
